  "details": "More favourite slots is a MUST, some without VRC+ admitted they would purchase if chances if it was either unlimited or 500+ favourite slots, they end up making alt accounts just to store favourite avatars. VRChat has Millions and Millions of avatars but there isn’t enough room to fit a good amount in the favs. It’s always at cap and it’s a constant fight trying to choose which one to keep.\n\nMore emojis would be fantastic!\n\nVRChat messaging system would be handy, you can talk to people if you’re busy on dealing with a situation, or you can talk to multiple people while you’re in a world. Just helps with that extra communication!\n\n—————————————————————\n\nThis section is for without VRC+. Anything to spread suggestions around to make the platform fun and less stressful.\n\nAge VERIFICATION ASAP please. Everyone is getting tired of dealing with children.\n\nAvatar/World creators - Let them have more control of their creations. Let there be a blacklist so certain people cannot use or access the world. If you want an avatar to be friends only, let that be an option, grant people certain access.\n\nIncrease upload size on Quest to at least 15. You’re always optimising the game so can’t you do something about boosting the upload size? Even if it’s a little.",
